    <DataNode elementId="Saturated-Fatty-Acyl-CoA" textLabel="a 2,3,4-saturated fatty acyl CoA" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="MNXM96076" dataSource="MetaNetX" />
      <Graphics centerX="350" centerY="500" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment>This class describes |FRAME:ACYL-COA &quot;acyl-CoAs&quot;| that do not contain any double bonds in the 2, 3, and 4 positions. Acyl-CoAs are oxoacids that have been activated by |FRAME: CO-A|. They are often classified by the length of their acyl moiety. This class includes the following sub-classes: |FRAME: Short-Chain-234-Saturated-acyl-CoAs &quot;Short-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acyl-CoAs&quot;| are derived from |FRAME: Short-chain-fatty-acids &quot;2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chains shorter than 6 carbons&quot;|. |FRAME: Medium-Chain-234-Saturated-acyl-CoAs &quot;Medium-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acyl-CoAs&quot;| are derived from |FRAME: Medium-chain-fatty-acids &quot;fatty acids with aliphatic chains of 6-12 carbons&quot;|. |FRAME: Long-Chain-234-Saturated-acyl-CoAs &quot;Long-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acyl-CoAs&quot;| are derived from |FRAME: Long-Chain-234-Saturated-Fatty-Acids &quot;2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chains of 13-22 carbons&quot;|. |FRAME: Very-long-Chain-234-Saturated-acyl-CoAs &quot;Very-long-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acyl-CoAs&quot;| are derived from |FRAME: Very-long-chain-fatty-acids &quot;fatty acids with aliphatic chains of 23 carbons or longer&quot;|.</Comment>
